Package: LiDAR
Type: Package
Title: LiDAR integrates ligand propagation and transcriptional responses to infer spatial cell–cell communication
Version: 0.1.1
Authors@R: person("Weiqi", "Wang", role = c("aut", "cre"),
    email = "Wangwq22@mails.tsinghua.edu.cn")
Description: A computational framework that uses inferred downstream
    transcriptional responses to constrain models of ligand propagation
    through tissue. Characterizes ligand-specific propagation patterns and
    quantifies the spatial correspondence between modeled ligand exposure
    and downstream transcriptional response in potential receiver cells.
    Enables the profiling of ligand-mediated cell-cell communication at
    the original spatial resolution of the input data.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.1.0)
Imports: methods, stats, utils, Matrix, SeuratObject, RANN, igraph, dplyr,
    stringr, R.utils
Suggests: Seurat, CelliD, dnet, testthat (>= 3.0.0), qs
Config/testthat/edition: 3
URL: https://github.com/wangweiqiwq/LiDAR
BugReports: https://github.com/wangweiqiwq/LiDAR/issues